{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29524","headline":"杏花 · 李商隐","name":"杏花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上国昔相值，亭亭如欲言。\n异乡今暂赏，眽眽岂无恩。\n援少风多力，墙高月有痕。\n爲含无限意，遂对不胜繁。\n仙子玉京路，主人金谷园。\n几时辞碧落，谁伴过黄昏。\n镜拂铅华腻，炉藏桂烬温。\n终应催竹叶，先拟咏桃根。\n莫学啼成血，从教梦寄魂。\n吴王采香径，失路入烟村。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29524.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29524","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}